			"notes": "# Changes since v0.18.3:\n\n## New enchantments:\n- **Calcium Burst**\n- **Decompose**\n- **Rebound**\n- **Demolition**\n- **Demeter's Wrath**\n- **Demeter's Aegis**\n- **Demeter's Grace**\n- **Poison Nova**\n- **Frost Nova**\n- **Healing Nova**\n- **Automata**\n\n## Updates:\n- Make _Blazing_ shoot Blaze fireballs instead of Ghast ones\n- Update _Blazing_ and _Fleeting_ max charge\n- Make _Mystic Blade_ reset iframes after the magic damage and not before\n- Let double harvest enchantments do more than 1 extra harvest, if the double harvest chance > 100% (e.g. through _Miner's Harvest_ with very strong Haste/Luck effect obtained via /effect)"
		},
